# Clang-Tidy Strict Static Analysis Configuration
---
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  misc-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  -readability-identifier-length,
  -readability-magic-numbers

WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: 'include/.*'
FormatStyle: file
CheckOptions:
  - key: readability-implicit-bool-conversion.AllowPointerConditions
    value: 1
